FLOW_CONTRACT 1
units SI
model planar_isothermal_laminar
geometry parallel_plates
grid 64 16 0.1 0.01
reporting_depth_m 1
reference_pressure_absolute_pa 101325
temperature_k 293.15
left pressure_absolute_pa 101325
right pressure_absolute_pa 101325
bottom no_slip 0
top no_slip 0
time_s 0.0005 5
velocity_component_bound_m_s 0.05
projection 20000 1e-7 1e-8 1e-7 1e-8
initial rest
end
